<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Cigar started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Cigar started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Consolidated Cigar Holdings Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst John Renwick was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 30-7/8.</p>
